<div class="page">
	<h1 class="current-page">SKILLS</h1>
	<hr class="thick-line">
</div>

<div class="skill-text">
	<h1 class="skills">My Work Skills</h1>
	<p>I have a strong foundation in front-end and back-end development, with skills in HTML, CSS, and C#, as well as experience working with SQL Server for database management. I also use Figma to design clean and modern user interfaces. Together, these skills allow me to build functional, visually appealing, and well-structured web applications from design to development.</p>
</div>


